# lucene-rust's own test dictionary: NOSPLITSUGS, ONLYMAXDIFF, SUBSTANDARD, PSEUDOROOT.
SET UTF-8
TRY esianrtolcdugmphbyfvkwz
NOSPLITSUGS
MAXDIFF 3
ONLYMAXDIFF
MAXNGRAMSUGS 4
SUBSTANDARD Z
PSEUDOROOT P
NOSUGGEST N

SFX S Y 1
SFX S 0 s .

SFX D Y 2
SFX D 0 ed [^e]
SFX D 0 d e

PFX R Y 1
PFX R 0 re .
